(
F5 W1 U2 (processors_maximum): force_point_sign1 with 4 threads. The
point force was applied once per thread inside parallel_new_dof_before
(disx 8 instead of 2 with 4 threads); force_point_calculate now runs
serially in top() before the threads start.
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
